This is test body text. Run this Dialogue if my_variable is 5 and then set it to be 1 greater. Setting a "Look at Manual" quest to active. Then link to 2 player options.

Conditions: Variable["my_variable"] == 5;

Script: SetQuestState("Look at Manual", "active"); 
Variable["my_variable"] = Variable["my_variable"] + 1;

[[Player Option 1 Conditions: Variable["bugTalk"] == 1;]]
[[Player Option 2]]
